Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded runtime benchmark parameters

Expose working sets, sample duration, repetitions and random-read count for
simulator runs while retaining upstream defaults and benchmark kernels.
Validate sizes against block processing, shift and allocator limits; reject
partial sixteen-access groups so the latency denominator stays accurate.

Upstream-Status: Pending

